{"speciesId":659,"names":{"fr":"Sapereau","es":"Bunnelby","en":"Bunnelby","ja":"ホルビー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ses larges oreilles lui permettent de creuser des terriers. Il est capable de forer sans s’arrêter pendant toute une nuit."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Usa sus grandes orejas para excavar en la tierra y así crear madrigueras. Puede pasarse una noche entera cavando sin parar."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"They use their large ears to dig burrows. They will dig the whole night through."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"大きな 耳で 地面を 掘って 巣穴を 作る。 一晩中 休まずに 掘り続けられる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il est doté d’oreilles ressemblant à des pelles. À force de creuser des galeries, leur puissance est telle qu’elles peuvent trancher de grosses racines."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Tiene unas orejas tan grandes que parecen palas. Las ha fortalecido tanto usándolas para excavar que son capaces de arrancar raíces bien gruesas."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It has ears like shovels. Digging holes strengthens its ears so much that they can sever thick roots effortlessly."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"シャベルのような 耳を 持つ。 穴掘りで 鍛えた 耳は 太い 根っこを 断ち切る 威力だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ses larges oreilles lui permettent de creuser des terriers. Il est capable de forer sans s’arrêter pendant toute une nuit."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Usa sus grandes orejas para excavar en la tierra y así crear madrigueras. Puede pasarse una noche entera cavando sin parar."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"They use their large ears to dig burrows. They will dig the whole night through."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"大きな 耳で 地面を 掘って 巣穴を 作る。 一晩中 休まずに 掘り続けられる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il est doté d’oreilles ressemblant à des pelles. À force de creuser des galeries, leur puissance est telle qu’elles peuvent trancher de grosses racines."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Tiene unas orejas tan grandes que parecen palas. Las ha fortalecido tanto usándolas para excavar que son capaces de arrancar raíces bien gruesas."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It has ears like shovels. Digging holes strengthens its ears so much that they can sever thick roots effortlessly."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"シャベルのような 耳を 持つ。 穴掘りで 鍛えた 耳は 太い 根っこを 断ち切る 威力だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il est très doué pour creuser avec ses oreilles. Il peut forer un terrier atteignant dix mètres de profondeur en une nuit."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Usa hábilmente las orejas para hacer hoyos. Es capaz de excavar una madriguera a 10 m bajo tierra en una sola noche."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It excels at digging holes. Using its ears, it can dig a nest 33 feet deep in one night."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"耳で 穴を 掘るのが 得意。 地下１０メートルに とどく 巣穴を 一晩で つくってしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il est sensible au danger. Lorsqu’il entend le battement d’ailes de Corvaillus, il creuse prestement un terrier et s’y cache."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Está en alerta permanente. En cuanto oye el batir de alas de un Corviknight, cava un agujero y se oculta bajo tierra."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It’s very sensitive to danger. The sound of Corviknight’s flapping will have Bunnelby digging a hole to hide underground in moments."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"危険に 敏感。 アーマーガアの 羽音を 聴きとると あっという間に 穴を 掘って 地面に 潜る。"}],"varieties":[{"id":659,"moves":[{"name":"double-slap","learns":[[15,"level-up",10],[16,"level-up",10],[17,"level-up",10],[18,"level-up",10]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[20,"level-up",33],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-kick","learns":[[15,"level-up",20],[16,"